1
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:09,740
Banyak orang ingin membaca Alkitab

2
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,100
dari awal sampai akhir.

3
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,440
Tapi sering berhenti di tengah jalan,

4
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,970
karena kitabnya banyak

5
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:16,240
dan ceritanya panjang.

6
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:17,250
Karena itu,

7
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:19,510
di seri ini kita belajar secara singkat.

8
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:20,600
Satu video,

9
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,870
satu tokoh Alkitab.

10
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,390
Dari Adam dan Hawa di kitab Kejadian,

11
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:26,140
sampai Yohanes di kitab Wahyu.

12
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:28,550
Kita akan bertemu Abraham,

13
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:28,950
Musa,

14
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:29,360
Daud,

15
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,170
dan Ester.

16
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:31,340
Lalu Maria,

17
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:32,080
Petrus,

18
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:32,910
dan Paulus.

19
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,350
Ada yang gagah berani,

20
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:35,460
ada yang ragu.

21
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:36,750
Ada yang jatuh,

22
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:37,770
lalu dipulihkan.

23
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,330
Tiap video berisi ringkasan kisahnya,

24
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:41,610
bacaan Alkitabnya,

25
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:44,120
dan satu pesan yang bisa kamu bawa pulang.

26
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:46,186
Supaya kamu bisa membaca sendiri

27
00:00:46,066 --> 00:00:47,590
kisah aslinya di Alkitab,

28
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:49,370
dan melihat bagaimana Allah

29
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:50,890
bekerja dalam hidup mereka.

30
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:52,750
Siap menyusuri Alkitab bersama?

31
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,370
Kita mulai dari awal,

32
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:55,530
dari kitab Kejadian.

